stateDiagram-v2
accTitle: Installing a new key is not the same as revoking the old key
accDescr: The guest authorization state changes from old-key access through a tested overlap to new-key-only access, using Systems Manager as an independent recovery path.
[*] --> OldAuthorized
OldAuthorized: Former public key is authorized
OldAuthorized --> BothAuthorized: Install replacement public key
BothAuthorized: Both keys can authenticate
BothAuthorized --> Tested: Verify replacement login
Tested --> NewOnly: Remove former public key
NewOnly: Only replacement key is authorized
NewOnly --> Verified: Confirm former key is rejected
Verified --> [*]
note right of BothAuthorized
Old access still works here
end note
